{
  "category": "Cotton Bird Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "SWABLU has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This POKéMON is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SWABLU loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this POKéMON finds a stream and showers itself.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, SWABLU flocks move closer to towns in the spring.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swablu has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This Pokémon is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swablu loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this Pokémon finds a stream and showers itself.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its cottony wings are full of air, making them light and fluffy to the touch. Swablu takes diligent care of its wings.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Since Swablu looks like a cumulus cloud, foes can have a hard time finding it. Apparently its wings turned white over many generations.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
